<% layout("/layouts/boiler") %>

<div class="container my-5">

    <a href="/listings" class="back-btn">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      Back to Listings
    </a>

    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="text-muted">
        Last Updated: July 2026
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h4>1. Introduction</h4>

    <p>
        Welcome to Wanderlust. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy
        Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal
        information when you use our platform.
    </p>

    <h4>2. Information We Collect</h4>

    <ul>
        <li>Name and account information</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Booking details</li>
        <li>Property listings created by hosts</li>
        <li>Usage and browsing information</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>3. How We Use Your Information</h4>

    <ul>
        <li>To manage bookings</li>
        <li>To improve user experience</li>
        <li>To communicate important updates</li>
        <li>To provide customer support</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>4. Data Security</h4>

    <p>
        We use reasonable security measures to protect your personal data.
        However, no method of online transmission is completely secure.
    </p>

    <h4>5. Cookies and Sessions</h4>

    <p>
    Wanderlust uses session cookies to maintain user authentication,
    manage login sessions, and provide features such as wishlists and
    bookings. These sessions help the application remember your
    authenticated state while you use the platform.
    </p>

    <h4>6. Third-Party Services</h4>

    <p>
    Wanderlust uses third-party services such as Cloudinary for image
    storage and MongoDB Atlas for database management.
    </p>



    <h4>7. Contact Us</h4>

    <p>
        If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please
        contact our support team.
    </p>

</div>